<title>HONG KONG: Kader Holdings H1 net loss HK$18.53 mln.</title>
<headline>Kader Holdings H1 net loss HK$18.53 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.8 loss   vs 5.1 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  5.0 loss   vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    18.53 loss vs 24.93 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     133.64     vs 106.25</p>
<p>    Company name		 Kader Holdings Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Kader Holdings makes toys.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on provision for a claim on January 10, 1991, against Kader Industrial Co Ltd for breaches of contracts for the supply of a number of its products.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
